---
description: >-
  Thorough code review (slower, Opus, uses more quota). Use INSTEAD of code-reviewer when the change
  is high-risk: authentication/authorization, payments/billing/Stripe, secrets or crypto, database
  migrations, schema changes or data deletion, concurrency/queues/caching, public API or webhook
  contracts, permission/security boundaries; or when it is large (roughly 10+ files or 300+ changed
  lines, or a cross-cutting refactor); or when the user asks for a thorough/deep/careful review.
mode: subagent
model: claude-agent/opus
permissions:
  - action: edit
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git diff*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git log*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git show*"
    effect: allow
---

